From cbf2736317161f372826a09b9cf77c0653b2a01d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 09:49:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] m3.msstyles: Add a Material 3 visual style.

Buttons, check boxes, radio buttons, edit and combo boxes, scroll bars,
tabs, headers, toolbars, tree views, track bars, spin buttons and
tooltips in the Material 3 style: tonal pill buttons, outlined fields,
thin scroll bar thumbs, tab indicators and chevrons. The other images
are those of the light theme in Material 3 roles.

Twelve color schemes, the six accents of the desktop in light and dark,
share the images through [WineRecolor]. Generated by
cachyos-ntsync/m3-tools/mkmsstyles.py from light.msstyles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019oF8nnfMD8z5Z1MeNXoYS9
